    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Mech Assembler, a relaxing puzzle game inspired by model kit building (Gunpla). You'll experience the tranquility of building a model kit, then painting it with Spry, using masking tape to avoid painting unwanted areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cut, assemble, paint, and customize your models! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647660/extras/b578783f943d57afb3ef0654b9e19a60.poster.avif?t=1749004105\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647660/extras/b578783f943d57afb3ef0654b9e19a60.webm?t=1749004105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647660/extras/b578783f943d57afb3ef0654b9e19a60.mp4?t=1749004105\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you complete a model kit, you earn points and in-game currency, which you can use to refill paint cans and unlock in-game items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All models and parts have been carefully designed for a relaxing experience.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Mech Assembler, a relaxing puzzle game inspired by model kit building (Gunpla). You'll experience the tranquility of building a model kit, then painting it with Spry, using masking tape to avoid painting unwanted areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cut, assemble, paint, and customize your models! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647660/extras/b578783f943d57afb3ef0654b9e19a60.poster.avif?t=1749004105\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647660/extras/b578783f943d57afb3ef0654b9e19a60.webm?t=1749004105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647660/extras/b578783f943d57afb3ef0654b9e19a60.mp4?t=1749004105\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you complete a model kit, you earn points and in-game currency, which you can use to refill paint cans and unlock in-game items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All models and parts have been carefully designed for a relaxing experience.</p>",
    "short_description": "Welcome to Mech Assembler, a relaxing puzzle game inspired by model kit (Gunpla) construction. You'll experience the relaxing process of building a model. Once assembled, you can paint it with Spry. Earn points based on your accuracy and unlock new elements.",
